        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que recupera todos los conceptos relacionados con el `concept_id` `939355` utilizando las tablas `concept`, `concept_relationship` y `relationship` del modelo OMOP.\n\nEsta consulta te devolverá:\n*   El `concept_id` y `concept_name` del concepto original (`939355`).\n*   El nombre del tipo de relación (`relationship_name`).\n*   El `concept_id`, `concept_name`, `domain_id` y `vocabulary_id` de los conceptos relacionados.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS original_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS original_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS original_domain_id,\n    c1.vocabulary_id AS original_vocabulary_id,\n    r.relationship_name,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS related_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n    `concept_relationship` AS cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    `relationship` AS r ON cr.relationship_id = r.relationship_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c2 ON cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 939355\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL -- Solo considerar relaciones válidas\n    AND c2.invalid_reason IS NULL -- Solo considerar conceptos relacionados válidos\nUNION ALL\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS original_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS original_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS original_domain_id,\n    c1.vocabulary_id AS original_vocabulary_id,\n    r.relationship_name,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS related_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n    `concept_relationship` AS cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_2 -- Maneja relaciones donde el concepto original es concept_id_2\nJOIN\n    `relationship` AS r ON cr.relationship_id = r.relationship_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c2 ON cr.concept_id_1 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 939355\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL\n    AND c2.invalid_reason IS NULL\n;\n```",
